WEBVTT

asr-000001
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:05.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron din pong mga public markets na nalalagay sa panganib na tuluyang magsara

asr-000002
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil sa mga hindi nagtagumpay ng mga privatization o joint venture agreements.

asr-000003
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May mga panahon din po na kinakain ng mga malalaking retailers

asr-000004
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:20.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang negosyo ng mga maliliit na mga vendors sa ating mga pampublikong palengke.

asr-000005
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May panahon din po na lagi pong nalalagay sa question

asr-000006
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang security of tenure ng mga market vendors,

asr-000007
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:33.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung participation mismo nila sa policy sa loob ng mga palengke.

asr-000008
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil po sa maraming concerns na yan,

asr-000009
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:41.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po ba panahon na para magkaroon halimbawa ng regional consultation

asr-000010
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o kung ano man sa tingin ng DILG na mainam po na mekanismo

asr-000011
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para marinig yung boses din ng mga market vendors?

asr-000012
00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, Mr. Speaker, there's always a consultation.

asr-000013
00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:56.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And just for the information of our good colleague,

asr-000014
00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: there was a DILG.

asr-000015
00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:02.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It's Joint Memorandum Circular No. 2019-01.

asr-000016
00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It guides local government units, LGUs,

asr-000017
00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:12.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: in setting just, reasonable, and standardized regulatory fees and service charges.

asr-000018
00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:16.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-000019
00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at mangingi po tayo ng pinakahuling ulat ng DILG tungkol dito.

asr-000020
00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:24.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita rin po kasi natin na sa kapangyarihan ng DILG,

asr-000021
00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:28.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pwede naman po siyang mag-initiate ng iba't ibang program.

asr-000022
00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:32.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po, di ba, meron po kayong paleng QRPH program

asr-000023
00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:36.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na tumutulong po kayo sa ating mga public markets

asr-000024
00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:41.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na magkaroon ng mas maraming opsyon for cashless payments.

asr-000025
00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:45.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung nagawa po ito ng DILG na mag-initiate ng ganito mga programa

asr-000026
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para tulungan ang ating mga public markets,

asr-000027
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:55.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sana po magkaroon din po tayo ng inisyatiba na nakalapat sa kalagayan ng mga vendors.

asr-000028
00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sana po kung wala pang konsultasyon,

asr-000029
00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:05.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: magkaroon na ng national consultation sa mga LGU, sa ating mga public markets

asr-000030
00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:08.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para po madinig din natin yung boses ng mga market vendors

asr-000031
00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ngayon po ay naghihingalo na ang kanila mga public markets

asr-000032
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:17.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at nananawagan po sila na sana may dagdag na suporta ang pambansang pamahalaan

asr-000033
00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para palakasin ang mga pampublikong merkado sa buong bansa.

asr-000034
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Totally agree, Madam Speaker.

asr-000035
00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:22.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

asr-000036
00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:23.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

asr-000037
00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bilang panghuli, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-000038
00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa BJMP cashless system

asr-000039
00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:37.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ipatupad sa pangmagitan ng Memorandum Circular No. 110.

asr-000040
00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Narisk ko po ito, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-000041
00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:47.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil meron po tayong mga ulat,

asr-000042
00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:55.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: halimbawa na sa ngayon po ba aamiyandahan na po itong cashless system na ito?

asr-000043
00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:57.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkakaiba po kasi yung...

asr-000044
00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:01.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga policies, no, kada institution

asr-000045
00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:06.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kung paano po natin maipapatupad ng maayos ang cashless system.

asr-000046
00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natanong ko lang po ito dahil sa Bucor, sa CIW,

asr-000047
00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:12.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagkaroon po ng issue ng nawawalang 6...

asr-000048
00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa 6 million pesos, 5 to 6 million pesos.

asr-000049
00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:21.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At dahil po dito, nais po natin sanang bantayan ng Kongreso

asr-000050
00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ang mga cashless system na ito,

asr-000051
00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi magkakaroon ng issue ng nawawalang pondo,

asr-000052
00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: magkakaroon ng issue ng korupsyon,

asr-000053
00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:36.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at hindi po magkakaroon ng issue kung saan napapahirapan po

asr-000054
00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:40.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o lalong nahihirapan yung mga PDLs na ma-access,

asr-000055
00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:45.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung mga pondo na nararapat lang po ay magamit nila.

asr-000056
00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:51.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil napakababa na nga po ng ating overhead na expense ng cost,

asr-000057
00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:58.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kada PDL, at mahirap po kung yung mga pondo na pumapasok,

asr-000058
00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:59.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung sa kanila through the cashless system,

asr-000059
00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:03.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay hindi maayos na ipapatupad at nabibigay sa kanila.

asr-000060
00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we totally agree with you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000061
00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, now may TWG na po na ginagawa,

asr-000062
00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Technical Working Group, para maisaayos po ito.

asr-000063
00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: At hindi lang po yan, nag-uusap na rin po ang BJMP,

asr-000064
00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:27.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: even ang Bucor, and even po ang Provincial Jail.

asr-000065
00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:27.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dapat po.

asr-000066
00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:31.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Nasa isang umbrella na lang para hindi po iba-iba

asr-000067
00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:37.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yung ating pinapatupad na mga alituntunin para po sa ating jail system.

asr-000068
00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, bilang huling katanungan,

asr-000069
00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kailan po matatapos itong pag-amienda,

asr-000070
00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: itong proseso po ng pagtawag natin ng Technical Working Group,

asr-000071
00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:51.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang consultation para po mas mapalakas ang ating safeguards

asr-000072
00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa paggamit ng cashless system?

asr-000073
00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:02.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Madam Speaker, may consultative meeting pa kasing ginagawa.

asr-000074
00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:07.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But as far as I know, we have to create a law regarding this,

asr-000075
00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kung paano mo pag-iisahin.

asr-000076
00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:14.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So it's not only we know the problem, we understand it,

asr-000077
00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and we have to do something about it.

asr-000078
00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:22.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: With the advice also of BGMP, even ng Bucor,

asr-000079
00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and ng ating mga Provincial Jails.

asr-000080
00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000081
00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:32.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Patuloy nating babantayan ang pagre-repaso ng cashless system na ito

asr-000082
00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa interest ng transparency ng accountability.

asr-000083
00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000084
00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:37.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000085
00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, can I ask for a two-minute suspension?

asr-000086
00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:42.760
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Session is suspended.

asr-000091
00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:29.980
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Session is resumed. Majority Leader.

asr-000092
00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:38.980
Floor Speaker: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate, I move to recognize Representative Antonio Tinio of ACT Teachers Party-list.

asr-000093
00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:44.960
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Honorable Antonio Tinio is recognized. You may proceed, sir.

asr-000094
00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:14.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Meron po tayong presentation para mapabilis.

asr-000095
00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:21.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang unang set of questions natin kaugnay pa rin dito sa Local Government Support Fund.

asr-000096
00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:28.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang particular na papel ng DILG,

asr-000097
00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:31.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: DILG dito, essentially, monitoring.

asr-000098
00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba? Monitoring and...

asr-000099
00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:36.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Monitoring, evaluation.

asr-000100
00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:43.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Monitoring and evaluation of the programs and projects under LGSF.

asr-000101
00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hindi kayo yung nag-approve.

asr-000102
00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi DILG yung nag-approve.

asr-000103
00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:49.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hindi po.

asr-000104
00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:50.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi.

asr-000105
00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: DBM po ang nag-approve. Parang gano'n, ano?

asr-000106
00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:54.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: As far as I know, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000107
00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:55.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes. Okay.

asr-000108
00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:56.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So...

asr-000109
00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:57.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Especially Falgo.

asr-000110
00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:58.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker.

asr-000111
00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:00.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Special Purpose Fund.

asr-000112
00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:02.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

asr-000113
00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:02.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Falgo.

asr-000114
00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:03.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry?

asr-000115
00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:04.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Falgo.

asr-000116
00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Financial assistance to LGUs.

asr-000117
00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:07.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000118
00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:09.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ito lang po.

asr-000119
00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:18.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, we have an idea kung paano yung tinakbo ng LGSF over the past decade from 2016.

asr-000120
00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:26.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2016, nasa mga 18.4 billion or 19 billion ng level, GAA.

asr-000121
00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:27.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yung...

asr-000122
00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:31.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yung blue, NEP, yung orange, GAA.

asr-000123
00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:42.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, we note, particularly in 2026.

asr-000124
00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:55.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya naman po na-focus ang attention dito dahil in 2026 ay relatively mababa yung proposal for LGSF

asr-000125
00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at 16.0.

asr-000126
00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:07.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero sa GAA, after dumaan sa Kongreso, BICAM, naging 57 billion.

asr-000127
00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:08.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-000128
00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bumukol talaga.

asr-000129
00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And you can see that, yung orange na lumaki.

asr-000130
00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:18.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, for 2027, imemaintain yung level na yun.

asr-000131
00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:21.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At least in the proposed budget.

asr-000132
00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:26.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: You can also see, for example, in 2022, malaki yung NEP.

asr-000133
00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:31.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Malaki yung NEP proposal, 2022, 51 billion.

asr-000134
00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:37.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero actual na in-approve ng Kongreso, 17.9 billion.

asr-000135
00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it works both ways, no?

asr-000136
00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:45.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In the past, malaki yung proposal ng Malacanang, binawasan ng Kongreso.

asr-000137
00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:54.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero the past, for 2026, maliitang proposal, tin-replay or more, ng Kongreso.

asr-000138
00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:56.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, sa susunod na taon...

asr-000139
00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ganun, mas malaki na rin naman, no?

asr-000140
00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:03.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Slightly higher than the current at 58 billion.

asr-000141
00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:04.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000142
00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:06.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon,

asr-000143
00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:15.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: isa sa mga pinakalaking, malaking dinagdagan, yung financial assistance to LGUs.

asr-000144
00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:16.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Falgo.

asr-000145
00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

asr-000146
00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:19.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, again, ayun yung data.

asr-000147
00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let's not...

asr-000148
00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi na masyadong palalaking pa.

asr-000149
00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Original proposal dyan, 5 billion.

asr-000150
00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:31.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Naging 37 billion sa GAA for 2026.

asr-000151
00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:37.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, 2027, same level ang proposal, 37.49 billion.

asr-000152
00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:38.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000153
00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:47.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, malinaw yung pinalobong Local Government Support Fund.

asr-000154
00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:49.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And the next...

asr-000155
00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:55.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para lang makita natin yung iba't-ibang components ng Local Government Support Fund,

asr-000156
00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bukod sa Falgo, yun yung pinakamalaki,

asr-000157
00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:05.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nandyan din yung Barangay Development Program ng NTFL-CAC.

asr-000158
00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it's at 9.7 billion.

asr-000159
00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:14.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, such things as the Growth Equity Fund and a few others.

asr-000160
00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:16.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero yun yung po yung mga pinakamalaki.

asr-000161
00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:17.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now,

asr-000162
00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:20.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang naging kontrobersyal po dito sa...

asr-000163
00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:21.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah...

asr-000164
00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:24.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particularly financial assistance...

asr-000165
00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to LGUs,

asr-000166
00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:28.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung allocation.

asr-000167
00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:30.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, we have...

asr-000168
00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:32.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for...

asr-000169
00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for 2025,

asr-000170
00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang financial assistance to LGUs

asr-000171
00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: was 5 billion lang.

asr-000172
00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:42.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry.

asr-000173
00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 18.9 billion.

asr-000174
00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 18.9 billion.

asr-000175
