00:46:18.860 --> 00:46:23.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung di man natupad ang mga ito, ano ang mga challenges?

asr-001153
00:46:24.200 --> 00:46:27.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kasama din po ba sa mga challenges na ito,

asr-001154
00:46:27.740 --> 00:46:28.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang nabanggit po ng NAPSI,

asr-001155
00:46:28.900 --> 00:46:37.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa isang Committee on Suffrage and Electoral Reforms meeting na observation na karamihan ng mga SKs, di na po kumpleto.

asr-001156
00:46:37.500 --> 00:46:38.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, Good Sponsor.

asr-001157
00:46:40.800 --> 00:46:50.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, regarding sa, we have the details from the BPAs, Across Centers of Participation.

asr-001158
00:46:53.740 --> 00:46:57.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Galing po ito sa SK web portal noong 2025.

asr-001159
00:46:58.900 --> 00:47:02.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And tuloy-tuloy pa rin yung pag-conduct ng activities.

asr-001160
00:47:03.480 --> 00:47:06.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: On governance, we have 22,729.

asr-001161
00:47:07.120 --> 00:47:10.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Active citizenships, 23,962.

asr-001162
00:47:10.940 --> 00:47:13.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Environment, 11,846.

asr-001163
00:47:14.800 --> 00:47:17.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Global mobility, 1,483.

asr-001164
00:47:17.720 --> 00:47:20.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Health, 19,105.

asr-001165
00:47:20.540 --> 00:47:23.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Education, 16,856.

asr-001166
00:47:24.100 --> 00:47:26.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Economic empowerment, 3,472.

asr-001167
00:47:27.820 --> 00:47:28.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Social inclusion and education.

asr-001168
00:47:28.900 --> 00:47:30.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Equity, 8,413.

asr-001169
00:47:31.200 --> 00:47:34.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Peace building and security, 5,774.

asr-001170
00:47:34.760 --> 00:47:36.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Agriculture, 1,831.

asr-001171
00:47:37.240 --> 00:47:39.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But we can submit it to you, Madam Speaker.

asr-001172
00:47:39.400 --> 00:47:40.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, Good Sponsor.

asr-001173
00:47:40.680 --> 00:47:42.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hingi rin po tayo ng ulat na ito.

asr-001174
00:47:42.700 --> 00:47:46.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kung ang datos po ay nasa SK,

asr-001175
00:47:46.500 --> 00:47:51.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung may compilation po ba sila ng mga sangguniang kabataan or mga councils

asr-001176
00:47:51.120 --> 00:47:55.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na for a period of time, siguro ng isang taon,

asr-001177
00:47:55.200 --> 00:47:57.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay hindi na po nakakapagdaos ng mga aktividad.

asr-001178
00:47:57.480 --> 00:47:58.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Would that be possible?

asr-001179
00:47:58.900 --> 00:47:59.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, Good Sponsor.

asr-001180
00:48:00.020 --> 00:48:02.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we will submit, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001181
00:48:02.520 --> 00:48:07.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Bilang principal author din po ang kabataan party list ng RA 11768

asr-001182
00:48:07.540 --> 00:48:09.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or SK Compensation and Empowerment Law,

asr-001183
00:48:09.900 --> 00:48:12.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kinakamusta din natin kung gaano ka-empowered ang SK natin.

asr-001184
00:48:13.380 --> 00:48:16.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung butas-butas ang mga konseo at hindi nakakapagtipon

asr-001185
00:48:16.920 --> 00:48:18.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para makapagsilbi sa kabataan,

asr-001186
00:48:19.200 --> 00:48:21.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kailangan po masolusyonan yun sa pinakakagyat.

asr-001187
00:48:21.380 --> 00:48:24.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kaya rin po, pinapanawagan ng kabataan party list na matuloy

asr-001188
00:48:24.940 --> 00:48:28.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang barangay at SK elections ngayong taon sa November 2026.

asr-001189
00:48:28.900 --> 00:48:31.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kaysa po, ipostpone siya ng 2028

asr-001190
00:48:31.520 --> 00:48:34.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para mapunan ang mga nabakanting mga posisyon

asr-001191
00:48:34.580 --> 00:48:36.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ilan pong ahensya na ang nagsabi

asr-001192
00:48:36.780 --> 00:48:39.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: noong naproblema po sa sangguniang kabataan.

asr-001193
00:48:39.760 --> 00:48:41.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And Mr. Speaker, Good Sponsor,

asr-001194
00:48:41.380 --> 00:48:45.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: final po na question tungkol sa sponsorship speech niyo pa lang.

asr-001195
00:48:46.020 --> 00:48:49.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tungkol po sa PNP Counterterrorism Center na nabanggit.

asr-001196
00:48:49.740 --> 00:48:51.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po bang dokumento o memo

asr-001197
00:48:51.740 --> 00:48:55.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nagtatatag ng PNP Counterterrorism Center?

asr-001198
00:48:55.860 --> 00:48:56.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maari po ba itong masumite?

asr-001199
00:48:56.860 --> 00:48:58.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang paunan na pong tanong,

asr-001200
00:48:59.000 --> 00:49:01.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano po ba ang scope ng duties and responsibilities

asr-001201
00:49:01.580 --> 00:49:02.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng itatayong center?

asr-001202
00:49:03.380 --> 00:49:05.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Well, this center na itatayo po,

asr-001203
00:49:06.040 --> 00:49:09.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: this is the, how do you explain it?

asr-001204
00:49:09.460 --> 00:49:10.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Data banking.

asr-001205
00:49:10.820 --> 00:49:13.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So hindi lang anti-terrorism nandyan,

asr-001206
00:49:14.200 --> 00:49:16.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: cyber security nandyan.

asr-001207
00:49:17.820 --> 00:49:21.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Even we need data-driven para po makapagplano

asr-001208
00:49:21.440 --> 00:49:23.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang ating pong PNP.

asr-001209
00:49:23.680 --> 00:49:26.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But pinaka-nakasentro po siya

asr-001210
00:49:26.140 --> 00:49:28.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dahil mahirap po paghiwahiwalay ang building.

asr-001211
00:49:28.900 --> 00:49:31.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Regarding operations also ng police.

asr-001212
00:49:31.920 --> 00:49:35.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, it's an anti-terrorism center

asr-001213
00:49:35.240 --> 00:49:39.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na nakapaloob na po dyan ang lahat

asr-001214
00:49:39.020 --> 00:49:44.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: regarding data and even lalo na operational system

asr-001215
00:49:44.000 --> 00:49:45.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ng ating pong kapulisan.

asr-001216
00:49:45.780 --> 00:49:48.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May memo po ba o dokumento na nagtatatag?

asr-001217
00:49:49.120 --> 00:49:51.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: This is part of the plan of the PNP.

asr-001218
00:49:52.380 --> 00:49:56.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: There are no memos but we have the design already

asr-001219
00:49:56.020 --> 00:49:58.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: of the building na ating itatatag.

asr-001220
00:49:58.880 --> 00:50:04.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil mas madali po na gumawa ng plano

asr-001221
00:50:04.260 --> 00:50:06.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lalo na kung may data banking ka.

asr-001222
00:50:06.640 --> 00:50:09.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mas madali pong operation na gawin

asr-001223
00:50:09.400 --> 00:50:11.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lalo na kung nandoon na po lahat.

asr-001224
00:50:11.880 --> 00:50:14.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, it's a center, data banking

asr-001225
00:50:14.020 --> 00:50:18.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and also paano po pag-operate

asr-001226
00:50:18.940 --> 00:50:20.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ng ating mga kapulisan.

asr-001227
00:50:22.160 --> 00:50:23.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, parang all in one.

asr-001228
00:50:23.760 --> 00:50:27.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hingi na lang din po tayo ng ulat tungkol sa disenyo

asr-001229
00:50:27.880 --> 00:50:29.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pati po yung konsepto

asr-001230
00:50:29.120 --> 00:50:31.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil po beyond the building

asr-001231
00:50:31.000 --> 00:50:32.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mukhang may pinaplano rin po na

asr-001232
00:50:32.860 --> 00:50:34.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dita-bank, cyber security nga po.

asr-001233
00:50:34.640 --> 00:50:35.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Madam Speaker,

asr-001234
00:50:36.220 --> 00:50:39.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: the establishment of the Integrated Facility

asr-001235
00:50:39.860 --> 00:50:42.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: for coordination, information sharing,

asr-001236
00:50:43.140 --> 00:50:46.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: operational readiness, technical capability,

asr-001237
00:50:46.680 --> 00:50:49.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: human rights, rule of law policy.

asr-001238
00:50:50.180 --> 00:50:52.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It will be located inside Camp Krame

asr-001239
00:50:52.680 --> 00:50:55.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: for Cyber Security Operations Center,

asr-001240
00:50:56.740 --> 00:50:57.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: PNP Bombing,

asr-001241
00:50:57.880 --> 00:51:02.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Information and Communications Technology Center,

asr-001242
00:51:02.960 --> 00:51:04.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Peace Process Development Center,

asr-001243
00:51:05.160 --> 00:51:08.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Human Rights Affairs Office, Madam Speaker.

asr-001244
00:51:09.420 --> 00:51:11.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hingi na lang po tayo ng ulat kung maaari

asr-001245
00:51:11.080 --> 00:51:12.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at ang konsepto rin po nang naibahagi.

asr-001246
00:51:12.540 --> 00:51:15.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We can give it to you by today.

asr-001247
00:51:15.600 --> 00:51:16.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sige po.

asr-001248
00:51:16.060 --> 00:51:17.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Papasero ko lang po ito.

asr-001249
00:51:17.420 --> 00:51:19.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-001250
00:51:19.760 --> 00:51:22.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang sunod po nating mga tanong ay tungkol po sa body-worn cameras.

asr-001251
00:51:23.360 --> 00:51:24.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito po ay mga naitanong na natin

asr-001252
00:51:25.500 --> 00:51:27.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at nagpapahayag mo ng pasasalamat

asr-001253
00:51:27.200 --> 00:51:28.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang representasyon na ito

asr-001254
00:51:28.460 --> 00:51:33.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa pagbigay po ng ulat na hiningi po natin

asr-001255
00:51:33.280 --> 00:51:35.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at gusto rin po nating mag-follow up.

asr-001256
00:51:36.100 --> 00:51:37.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Gaya po, for example,

asr-001257
00:51:38.720 --> 00:51:42.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ina-outline po ng body-worn camera guidelines

asr-001258
00:51:42.080 --> 00:51:45.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang paggamit nito during police operations.

asr-001259
00:51:45.700 --> 00:51:46.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po ba nating matanong,

asr-001260
00:51:47.200 --> 00:51:49.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kasama po ba ang mga mobilisasyon

asr-001261
00:51:49.280 --> 00:51:53.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na police operations na gagamitan ng body-worn cameras?

asr-001262
00:51:53.640 --> 00:51:54.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung ganun po,

asr-001263
00:51:54.820 --> 00:51:57.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: roughly how many officers po ang

asr-001264
00:51:57.200 --> 00:51:59.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: magsusot ng body-worn cameras

asr-001265
00:51:59.380 --> 00:52:00.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: tuwing may mobilisasyon?

asr-001266
00:52:01.120 --> 00:52:03.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, sad to say, Mr. Speaker,

asr-001267
00:52:03.860 --> 00:52:07.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang body-worn cameras natin ay 2,600 lamang.

asr-001268
00:52:08.660 --> 00:52:09.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, sobra pong kulang.

asr-001269
00:52:10.140 --> 00:52:11.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pero ang kinaganda po,

asr-001270
00:52:11.400 --> 00:52:14.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dati ay nabibili natin yung body camera ng 60,

asr-001271
00:52:14.620 --> 00:52:17.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nababa na po ng mga nasa 20 to 30.

asr-001272
00:52:17.760 --> 00:52:21.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But because of budget constraint,

asr-001273
00:52:22.460 --> 00:52:24.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: so as of now, we only have 2,600.

asr-001274
00:52:25.040 --> 00:52:26.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At ginagamit po ito

asr-001275
00:52:26.500 --> 00:52:27.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: during police operations,

asr-001276
00:52:27.860 --> 00:52:29.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: as stated nga po.

asr-001277
00:52:29.480 --> 00:52:31.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kasama po dito ang mga,

asr-001278
00:52:31.340 --> 00:52:33.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for example, mobilisasyons or rallies

asr-001279
00:52:33.260 --> 00:52:35.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung saan may mga nakadeploy din pong police.

asr-001280
00:52:35.580 --> 00:52:37.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: To confirm, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-001281
00:52:38.180 --> 00:52:39.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I cannot be specific,

asr-001282
00:52:39.700 --> 00:52:41.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: but they use it for operations, Madam Speaker.

asr-001283
00:52:42.380 --> 00:52:44.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Gusto rin po natin kasing ikumpirma.

asr-001284
00:52:44.320 --> 00:52:48.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: For example, may recent lang po na mobilisasyon

asr-001285
00:52:48.360 --> 00:52:51.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the September 21, kahapon po.

asr-001286
00:52:53.160 --> 00:52:54.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po bang may kumpirma

asr-001287
00:52:54.500 --> 00:52:56.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung ginamit po ang mga body-worn cameras?

asr-001288
00:52:56.500 --> 00:52:58.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: During yung deployment ng officers doon?

asr-001289
00:53:01.780 --> 00:53:04.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Can you repeat the sample?

asr-001290
00:53:04.700 --> 00:53:07.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa deployment of police officers po,

asr-001291
00:53:08.020 --> 00:53:10.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yesterday, sa September 21 mobilisasyon,

asr-001292
00:53:10.660 --> 00:53:12.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nagamit po ba ang mga body-worn cameras?

asr-001293
00:53:12.680 --> 00:53:14.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001294
00:53:14.680 --> 00:53:14.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ah, sige.

asr-001295
00:53:15.440 --> 00:53:16.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-001296
00:53:18.360 --> 00:53:20.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ukol nga rin po sa specifications and standards

asr-001297
00:53:20.780 --> 00:53:23.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga body-worn cameras,

asr-001298
00:53:23.220 --> 00:53:26.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nagsumite ang ahensya ng kopya ng Memorandum Circular No.

asr-001299
00:53:26.500 --> 00:53:29.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2024-58, na naglalahad ng technical specifications.

asr-001300
00:53:30.720 --> 00:53:32.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Nabanggit din po ng ahensya sa committee hearing

asr-001301
00:53:32.800 --> 00:53:36.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na magpaprocure po ito ng mga bagong AI-capable BWCs

asr-001302
00:53:36.780 --> 00:53:38.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na magagamit ng mga polis.

asr-001303
00:53:38.660 --> 00:53:40.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Applicable pa ba ang mga technical specs

asr-001304
00:53:40.780 --> 00:53:43.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nakalagay sa memo two years ago

asr-001305
00:53:43.300 --> 00:53:45.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: bilang standard ng PNP?

asr-001306
00:53:45.620 --> 00:53:46.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-001307
00:53:49.020 --> 00:53:50.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, Mr. Speaker,

asr-001308
00:53:51.080 --> 00:53:53.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lagi po natin ina-update every time

asr-001309
00:53:53.220 --> 00:53:56.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kasi alam na po natin yung technical specifications

asr-001310
00:53:56.500 --> 00:53:59.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: is laging nag-update rin.

asr-001311
00:54:00.060 --> 00:54:03.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, we are trying to get the best of the best

asr-001312
00:54:03.320 --> 00:54:06.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na kaya rin po natin yung presyo.

asr-001313
00:54:06.940 --> 00:54:10.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, yung sinumiti po bang Memo Circular 2024

asr-001314
00:54:10.920 --> 00:54:13.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nandun yung technical specifications,

asr-001315
00:54:13.380 --> 00:54:14.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: outdated na po ba ito?

asr-001316
00:54:14.780 --> 00:54:16.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dahil nga po, as mentioned,

asr-001317
00:54:16.300 --> 00:54:17.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nag-evolve na yung teknolohiya

asr-001318
00:54:17.820 --> 00:54:21.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in relation sa paano maging AI-capable ang BWCs.

asr-001319
00:54:22.000 --> 00:54:23.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, May 2024 po tayo,

asr-001320
00:54:23.960 --> 00:54:25.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pero ina-update po natin ito

asr-001321
00:54:25.620 --> 00:54:32.210
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: para maging responsive sa pangangailangan ng ating pong kapulisan, especially on operations.

asr-001322
00:54:32.210 --> 00:54:37.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May bagong memo na po ba na naglalahad ng mga bagong technical specifications?

asr-001323
